{"name": "warmup.mzn", "language": "minizinc", "label": "MiniZinc", "code": "% 手順1　二つの未知の整数を条件で決める。\nvar 1..4: x;\nvar 1..4: y;\nconstraint x < y;\nconstraint x + y = 5;\nsolve satisfy;\noutput [\"x = \" ++ show(x) ++ \", y = \" ++ show(y) ++ \"\\n\"];\n", "lines": ["<span class=\"co\">% 手順1　二つの未知の整数を条件で決める。</span>", "<span class=\"dt\">var</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">..</span><span class=\"dv\">4</span>: x;", "<span class=\"dt\">var</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">..</span><span class=\"dv\">4</span>: y;", "<span class=\"kw\">constraint</span> x <span class=\"op\">&lt;</span> y;", "<span class=\"kw\">constraint</span> x <span class=\"op\">+</span> y <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">5</span>;", "<span class=\"kw\">solve</span> <span class=\"kw\">satisfy</span>;", "<span class=\"kw\">output</span> [<span class=\"st\">&quot;x = &quot;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span> <span class=\"fu\">show</span>(x) <span class=\"op\">++</span> <span class=\"st\">&quot;, y = &quot;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span> <span class=\"fu\">show</span>(y) <span class=\"op\">++</span> <span class=\"st\">&quot;</span><span class=\"sc\">\\n</span><span class=\"st\">&quot;</span>];"]}